WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.670
- I am happy to be
covering for Kelly today.

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.400
She was, you know, I've
never hosted a show before.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.393
This is my first time hosting any show.

00:00:06.393 --> 00:00:07.824
(audience cheers)

00:00:07.824 --> 00:00:10.110
I've never hosted a show.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.980
So she was kind enough to leave me a note

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.340
with some hosting tips, especially for me.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.810
So here we go.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.287
This is a note from Kelly.

00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:21.450
"Hi Kumail.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.494
Thank you for taking such
good care of my show."

00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:27.660
Aw, don't get ahead of yourself, Kelly.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.493
I just started.

00:00:28.493 --> 00:00:29.326
(audience laughs)

00:00:29.326 --> 00:00:30.933
Things could go south.

00:00:32.077 --> 00:00:34.440
"I truly appreciate you guest hosting

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.060
and making Marvel movies."

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.417
Oh, that's kind.

00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:40.630
"Here are a few tips
while you're at the show

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:42.630
that may help you.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:46.180
Tip number one, compliment Rubin's suit."

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:47.947
(audience laughs)

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.298
"He warms up the audience"

00:00:49.298 --> 00:00:51.877
(audience cheers)

00:00:51.877 --> 00:00:53.610
"and will get them extra warm

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.840
if you tell him he looks nice."

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.550
Man, you look really nice.

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:57.690
- Give it up for my man, come on.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.839
- [Kumail] Look at that.

00:00:58.839 --> 00:00:59.815
- Yeah!

00:00:59.815 --> 00:01:01.482
- That's very sharp.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.593
That is very sharp.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:06.383
Well done.

00:01:06.383 --> 00:01:08.910
"Tip number two, the
band will play a sting

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.089
whenever you say, welcome
to Chippendale's Takeover."

00:01:12.089 --> 00:01:14.765
(band plays)

00:01:14.765 --> 00:01:17.250
Yeah, thank you.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.660
I should take you guys around.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:21.667
That's an awesome thing to
just have happen in my life.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.540
"If you scream, I'm
wearing lace underwear,

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:26.580
something awesome happens."

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.623
I'm wearing lace underwear.

00:01:30.705 --> 00:01:32.707
(audience laughs)

00:01:32.707 --> 00:01:34.838
"Just kidding about that last one."

00:01:34.838 --> 00:01:36.360
(audience laughs)

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.257
Thanks a lot, Kelly.

00:01:37.257 --> 00:01:38.587
(audience applauds)

00:01:38.587 --> 00:01:39.720
"Thank you.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:40.647
Have fun."

